    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d77">

                <pb facs="0233" n="115" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg115"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.85/74: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Collier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-24T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 24,
                                1928—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 5 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>20. Parliamentary Tariff Commission has included in proposed tariff law provision
                    to rebate duties [on] certain articles arriving Chile in Chilean vessels (see my
                    telegram of November 9, 5 p.m., 172<anchor n="2" xml:id="d77-f1"/>), but as
                    result of my representations Minister of Hacienda has asked President of Senate
                    in the name of Government to suppress this article.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Collier</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
